.TH AVR\-ORG\-INSTALL\-REMOVE 1 "" "avr 0.1.4" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-install-remove \- Remove/suspend a GitHub installation.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org install remove
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove/suspend a GitHub installation.
.PP
Confirms before suspending; pass --yes to skip the prompt (required when stdout isn't a TTY, e.g. in CI).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-installation\-id\fR \fITEXT\fR
Installation ID to remove (ins-xxx format) (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-y\fR
Skip confirmation prompt.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-install (1),
.BR avr-org-install-add (1),
.BR avr-org-install-list (1)
